  "system": {
    "description": "<p><strong>Anomaly</strong></p><p>Make a <strong>Power Roll</strong> against a target within Close range. On a success, <strong>spend a Hope</strong> to deal <strong>d12+3</strong> energy damage using your Proficiency. If the target marks their last Hit Point from this attack, you can <strong>mark a Stress</strong> to immediately repeat this attack once and make a Power Reaction Roll against another adversary within Close range of the defeated target.</p><p><strong>Escalation:</strong> On a success, you may <strong>give the GM a Fear</strong>. If you do, the void's hunger becomes insatiable. As long as a target marks their last Hit Point from this attack, you can continue to repeat the attack against a new target within Close range of the last target. You do not need to mark additional Stress for these subsequent attacks. The chain ends when an attack fails, or a target survives.</p>",
